  "contentHtml": "<p>재해, 재난과 안전에 대해 학습한 후 시중에 나와 있는 영화로 제작된 사례가 아닌 새로운 사례로 영화 포스터 제작하는 활동을 진행해봤습니다!</p><p>제 생각보다 너무 퀄리티가 좋은 작품이 많이 나와서 놀랐어요~!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05bb5f1eb852c2a5401d61c69fe2acb5634ff71d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05bb5f1eb852c2a5401d61c69fe2acb5634ff71d\" data-origin-width=\"595\" data-origin-height=\"689\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ee650b69230bd4cbd8042f3cbadc437bd2d8fec4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ee650b69230bd4cbd8042f3cbadc437bd2d8fec4\" data-origin-width=\"593\" data-origin-height=\"698\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c2095ef1b6aa1524c515605c53b0156e03e460c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c2095ef1b6aa1524c515605c53b0156e03e460c\" data-origin-width=\"595\" data-origin-height=\"698\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cddc0082f6c8f178902bb24bee68291a7bf55b27\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cddc0082f6c8f178902bb24bee68291a7bf55b27\" data-origin-width=\"594\" data-origin-height=\"691\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f794549d2e465e2f3af0eff5a24d98ac680474fc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f794549d2e465e2f3af0eff5a24